The controller initialization/reset sequences in Epaper7in3e.cpp and
Epaper13in3e.cpp are adapted from Waveshare team's MIT-licensed drivers:

7.3-inch EPD_7in3e (V1.0, 2022-10-20):
https://github.com/waveshareteam/e-Paper/blob/master/Arduino_R4/src/e-Paper/EPD_7in3e.cpp

13.3-inch EPD_13in3e (V1.0, 2018-11-29, as identified in its header):
https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-ePaper-13.3E6/blob/main/example/Arduino-3.2.0/examples/03_E-Paper_Example/EPD_13in3e.cpp

